            "description": "# BeosinKYT\n\nA python client for [BeosinKYT API](https://beosinofficials-organization.gitbook.io/kyt-api-documentation/)\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip3 install BeosinKYT\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```python\nfrom beosinkyt import BeosinKYT\nfrom beosinkyt.data import platforms, currency\nfrom beosinkyt.errors import NO_ERROR\n\n# Create a BeosinKYT object\napi = BeosinKYT(app_id=\"your app id\", app_secret=\"your app secret\")\n# Call api\naddress = \"0x39cc5c33e49c6583f4ac321562236227b8641311\"\ndetail, code, msg = api.get_addr_detail(\n    platform=platforms.ETH,\n    currency=currency.ETH,\n    address=address,\n)\n# Error handling\nif code == NO_ERROR:\n    print(detail)\nelse:\n    print(code, msg)\n```\n",
            "description_content_type": "text/markdown",
